{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/863314297870221312/868454671038181396/prisimdragon2.jpg","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:53:59.043000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868913990779174942","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"*The Dragon is composed purely of light and color, it's silhouette bending and changing, it's size stretching large, so large you can barely perceive it, and yet it stands before you, and says two words.* \"**Hello Bo.**\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:55:26.645000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868914358208581644","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"Well howdy fella!\" Bo says with a smile.","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:55:55.159000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868914477804953640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"*The dragon... Giggles.*\n**\"I've heard alot about you, my master told me you wanted to talk? I heard you calling to me, you were very polite.\"**","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:56:48.598000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868914701944377426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"As a wise man told me, bo is bo. He urged me to stay as I amb to stay true to myself. Ain't no need but for me to be polite!\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T17:58:13.068000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868915056237232128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"*The Dragon... Nods.*\n\"**It's Very good to be polite... So Bo, you wanted something?**\" *The otherworldly creature asks with a turn of its head, it's voice resonating all around you, within you...*","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:02:05.880000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868916032721535026","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"Master Malathor asked what i desire... I answered.\" He pauses a moment. \"I desire the power to stop my friends from dying, no matter the cost it takes on me!\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:03:40.717000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868916430496739329","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"*The Dragon stares with eyes containing every color contained in the visual light spectrum... And some beyond it.* \n\"**Yeah?... Okay then!**\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:05:47.904000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868916963957678100","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"Bo blinks a moment. \"Might i know your name perhaps?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:08:59.247000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868917766508384286","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"Its always good to make new friends!\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:10:18.744000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868918099942981702","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"*The Dragon nods again.* \"**Mhm, sure! I didn't have a name before... But a nice man named Isaac gave me a name a little while ago! My name is Spectra!**\" *The Dragon speaks with exuberance.*","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:11:42.726000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868918452189007882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"Bo bows,\" it is a pleasure to meet ya!\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:12:24.621000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868918627909378068","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"*Spectra bounces a bit, and your eyes strain to follow the movement.* \"**Okay, so you want to be able to protect your friends? I'll help you with that! You just gotta give me somethin' in return...**\" *The Dragon says as everything grows deathly quiet.*","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:15:04.621000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-25T18:15:24.356000Z","id":"868919298998042685","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
