{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"He says with a smile","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:17:13.865000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868919841086660648","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"*The Dragon looks at you confused for a few seconds, before it giggles again.* \"**No silly, you just gotta make a promise!**\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:17:54.126000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868920009953509427","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"Oh?\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:18:28.077000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868920152354332692","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"*Spectra moves closer and you feel as though your being approached by a rainbow, you're not sure if she shifted a few feet closer, or suddenly crossed hundreds of miles...* \n\"**You must promise to always be a good friend, Laugh at everything, because it's always funny. You must never be cruel and never be cowardly. And if you ever are, always make amends... Can you promise me that Bo?**\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:20:54.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868920766580809808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
