{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"*Spectra cocks their head again, studying the gesture before smiling.* \"**Okay then, pinky promise!**\" *The Dragon raises its colossal limb that could likely stretch around the rings of Saturn... And extends a single digit, touching the tip of its scintillating colorful claw to Bo's pinky.*","created_at":"2021-07-25T18:26:51.133000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868922262324142091","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
